  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, ginger, and garlic and saut\u0017 until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the boudin noir and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add the tomato puree, garam masala, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
